cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this dataset, please cite it as below.
title: Superior Tips settled football predictions
abstract: >-
  An append-only record of football predictions published before kickoff and graded after the final
  whistle, wins and losses both. One row per settled selection: kickoff, competition, teams, market,
  the selection as published, the price it was published at, the model probability from the frozen
  pre-match snapshot, the final regulation score and the grade.
type: dataset
authors:
  - name: Superior Football Desk
    website: https://superiortips.com
    email: contact@superiortips.com
repository-code: https://github.com/st0jka/superior-tips-predictions-dataset
url: https://superiortips.com/proof
license: CC-BY-4.0
keywords:
  - football
  - soccer
  - prediction
  - forecast evaluation
  - calibration
  - sports analytics
